00:03:23.147 --> 00:03:30.084
<v Host>The kittens were born on May twelfth this year. At birth, they weighed about one hundred fifty grams.

00:03:30.683 --> 00:03:32.987
<v Vocab>体重

00:03:33.388 --> 00:03:35.163
<v Host>It means body weight.

00:03:35.764 --> 00:03:49.348
<v Slow>今は、ごはんをたくさん食べて、元気に育っています。ほとんどの赤ちゃんは、1キロより重くなりました。

00:03:50.147 --> 00:03:56.867
<v Host>Now they eat a lot and are growing up healthy. Most of the kittens are heavier than one kilogram.

00:03:57.467 --> 00:03:59.819
<v Vocab>育つ

00:04:00.219 --> 00:04:02.068
<v Host>It means to grow up.

00:04:02.668 --> 00:04:10.276
<v Slow>5匹の名前は、「サン」「コモレビ」「ハク」「ボノ」「ナギ」に決まりました。

00:04:11.075 --> 00:04:18.276
<v Host>The five kittens' names have been decided: San, Komorebi, Haku, Bono, and Nagi.

00:04:18.875 --> 00:04:21.036
<v Vocab>決まる

00:04:21.435 --> 00:04:23.331
<v Host>It means to be decided.

00:04:23.932 --> 00:04:32.235
<v Slow>お母さんのアズは、いつも赤ちゃんのそばで、優しく育てています。

00:04:33.036 --> 00:04:37.475
<v Host>The mother is always close to her kittens, raising them gently.

00:04:38.076 --> 00:04:40.524
<v Vocab>育てる

00:04:40.923 --> 00:04:43.588
<v Host>It means to raise or bring up.

00:04:44.187 --> 00:04:58.540
<v Slow>赤ちゃんは、午前と午後の決まった時間に見ることができます。動物の体調が悪いときは、中止になることもあります。

00:04:59.339 --> 00:05:08.363
<v Host>Visitors can see the kittens at set times in the morning and afternoon. When the animals are not feeling well, the viewing may be canceled.

00:05:08.963 --> 00:05:11.339
